            "eyebrow": "Workflows",
            "heading": "Build Advanced Workflows",
            "body_html": "<p>Give users advanced scheduling capabilities so they can:</p> <ul> <li>Map <a href=\"/products/scheduler/examples/dependencies/\">task dependencies</a></li> <li><a href=\"/products/scheduler/examples/partners/\">Sync events</a></li> <li><a href=\"/products/scheduler/examples/merge-cells/\">Merge events</a></li> </ul>",
            "body_text": "Give users advanced scheduling capabilities so they can: Map task dependencies Sync events Merge events",
            "links": [
