        {
            "id": "block_35b80aec3b5a6c0ba5ef9594bd1ce23f",
            "type": "text-media",
            "modifiers": ["video-file", "added-shadow"],
            "eyebrow": "Planning",
            "heading": "Streamlined Planning",
            "body_html": "<p>Scheduler Enterprise adds event and capacity summaries to back up every decision. Plan and schedule confidently knowing you can:</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"/products/scheduler/examples/tree-summary-custom/\">Stop task overallocation</a></li> <li><a href=\"/products/scheduler/examples/summary/\">Check the totals</a> across events and other categories</li> <li>View <a href=\"/products/scheduler/examples/groupsummary/\">group summaries</a></li> <li>Show <a href=\"/products/scheduler/examples/tree-summary/\">group capacity caps</a></li> </ul>",
            "body_text": "Scheduler Enterprise adds event and capacity summaries to back up every decision. Plan and schedule confidently knowing you can: Stop task overallocation Check the totals across events and other categories View group summaries Show group capacity caps",
            "links": [
                {
                    "text": "Stop task overallocation",
                    "href": "/products/scheduler/examples/tree-summary-custom/"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Check the totals",
                    "href": "/products/scheduler/examples/summary/"
                },
                {
                    "text": "group summaries",
                    "href": "/products/scheduler/examples/groupsummary/"
                },
                {
                    "text": "group capacity caps",
                    "href": "/products/scheduler/examples/tree-summary/"
                }
            ],
            "ctas": [],
            "media": [
                {
                    "kind": "video",
                    "src": "../assets/scheduler/scheduler-overallocation-svalbard-2.mp4",
                    "src_original": "https://bryntum.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/scheduler-overallocation-svalbard-2.mp4"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "block_86cff8bcd91213c53bcd78636afc0cd6",
            "type": "text-media",
            "modifiers": ["image", "reverse", "added-shadow"],
            "eyebrow": "Resource Management",
            "heading": "See Every Resource’s Workload",
            "body_html": "<p>Scheduler Enterprise adds a resource histogram that tracks your team’s workload so you can decide faster and more fairly.</p> <ul> <li>Bright red highlights make over-capacity workloads obvious at a glance. No digging through tables or reports.</li> <li>Tweak task assignments to keep the plan balanced.</li> </ul>",
            "body_text": "Scheduler Enterprise adds a resource histogram that tracks your team’s workload so you can decide faster and more fairly. Bright red highlights make over-capacity workloads obvious at a glance. No digging through tables or reports. Tweak task assignments to keep the plan balanced.",
            "links": [],
            "ctas": [
                {
                    "text": "Open demo",
                    "href": "/products/scheduler/examples/resourcehistogram/",
                    "title": "Open demo"
                }
            ],
            "media": [
                {
                    "kind": "image",
                    "src": "../assets/scheduler/schedulerpro-resourcehistogram-svalbard-2-scaled.png",
                    "alt": "Scheduler with a resource histogram below the schedule, red bars marking over-allocated team members",
                    "width": "1240",
                    "height": "663",
                    "src_original": "https://bryntum.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/schedulerpro-resourcehistogram-svalbard-2-scaled.png"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "block_b27deebef856877e482370a5bc9b1a9a",
            "type": "text-media",
            "modifiers": ["video-file", "added-shadow"],
            "eyebrow": "Smart Assignment",
            "heading": "Assign Tasks by Skill",
            "body_html": "<p>Let the Enterprise tier handle the logic behind the scenes so planning stays efficient:</p> <ul> <li>Match the right tasks with the right people without fuss.</li> <li>Pair tasks with teammates based on skills and availability.</li> <li>Auto-schedule tasks or drag them into suggested time slots.</li> </ul>",
            "body_text": "Let the Enterprise tier handle the logic behind the scenes so planning stays efficient: Match the right tasks with the right people without fuss. Pair tasks with teammates based on skills and availability. Auto-schedule tasks or drag them into suggested time slots.",
            "links": [],
            "ctas": [
                {
                    "text": "Open demo",
                    "href": "/products/scheduler/examples/skill-matching/",
                    "title": "Open demo"
                }
            ],
            "media": [
                {
