                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "block_db9616ac89f5620c3b5018eb7d1c9498",
            "type": "text-media",
            "modifiers": ["image", "reverse", "added-shadow"],
            "eyebrow": "Auto-Scheduling",
            "heading": "Plan for the Real World",
            "body_html": "<p>Enterprise keeps the plan realistic as conditions change:</p> <ul> <li>Spot peak activity windows and overloaded categories via the heatmap.</li> <li>Lean on <a href=\"/products/scheduler/examples/nested-events-dependencies/\">nested events</a> to make related-task handling simpler.</li> <li><a href=\"/products/scheduler/examples/travel-time/\">Factor travel time in</a> for tighter callout and field-routing planning.</li> <li>Settle <a href=\"/products/scheduler/examples/conflicts/\">scheduling conflicts</a> and keep the schedule intact.</li> </ul>",
            "body_text": "Enterprise keeps the plan realistic as conditions change: Spot peak activity windows and overloaded categories via the heatmap. Lean on nested events to make related-task handling simpler. Factor travel time in for tighter callout and field-routing planning. Settle scheduling conflicts and keep the schedule intact.",
            "links": [
                {
                    "text": "nested events",
                    "href": "/products/scheduler/examples/nested-events-dependencies/"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Factor travel time in",
                    "href": "/products/scheduler/examples/travel-time/"
                },
                {
                    "text": "scheduling conflicts",
                    "href": "/products/scheduler/examples/conflicts/"
                }
            ],
            "ctas": [
                {
                    "text": "Open demo",
                    "href": "/products/scheduler/examples/tree-summary/",
                    "title": "Open demo"
                }
            ],
            "media": [
                {
                    "kind": "image",
                    "src": "../assets/scheduler/schedulerpro-tree-summary-heatmap-svalbard-scaled.png",
                    "alt": "Tree view with a heatmap of daily event counts per country and event category",
                    "width": "1240",
                    "height": "762",
                    "src_original": "https://bryntum.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/schedulerpro-tree-summary-heatmap-svalbard-scaled.png"
                }
            ]
